creatures:
- name: Young Silver Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 18  
      **Hit Points** 168 (rollable(dice=16d10 + 80,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 80 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Initiative) (14)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** History rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=History Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** cold  
      **Senses** blindsight 30 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 18  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 9 (5,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Paralyzing Breath.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage.

      ***Cold Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Cold Breath])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 17, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=11d8,dicelabel=Damage [Cold Breath]) Cold damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Paralyzing Breath.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 17, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. *First Failure:* The target has the ***Incapacitated*** condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save. *Second Failure:* The target has the ***Paralyzed*** condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Dragon (Metallic), Lawful Good*  
    **Challenge** 9
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024youngsilverdragon
  status: 1

